      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo Musa ni Aaroni be baabala nga bayambibwaku abakulembeze mu Isiraeli eikumi n'ababiri. Buli mulala ku abo yali nga n'akulembera ekika kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Abaisiraeli boonaboona abaali bagheza emyaka amakumi abiri n'okusingagho, era abaali basobola okulwana mu lutalo, nga baabalibwa nga bajiira ku nda dha baiseibwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baali emitwalo nkaaga n'enkumi isatu na bitaanu n'ataanu (603,550).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Abalevi tibaabalibwa ghalala na bika bindi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba Musengwa Katonda yakoba Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ab'ekika ky'Abalevi otababala, era obungi bwaibwe otabugaita ku bwa Baisiraeli banaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye oidha kubagha ogw'okulabiriranga Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda, n'ebikozesebwamu byonabyona. Baidha kugibbeedanga okugitwala n'ebikozesebwamu byonabyona, n'okukolanga emirimo gyamu. Era baidha kusimbanga eweema dhaibwe okugyezungulula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli lwe munaagisengulanga, Abalevi n'abanaagisimbulangagho, era buli ghe munaagisimbanga, Abalevi n'abanaagisimbangagho. Atali Mulevi bw'anaagiseetangaku aidha kwitibwanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli abandi boonaboona baidha kusimbanga weema dhaibwe mu bibbuututu buli muntu mu kikunsu kye aghali bendera yaakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Abalevi baidha kusimbanga weema dhaibwe okwezungulula Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda, olwo Abaisiraeli balobe kusungughalirwa. Era Abalevi n'abanaabanga n'obuvunaanizibwa ku Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Abaisiraeli abo baakola byonabyona Musengwa Katonda bye yalagira Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
